data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-b-media","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_003b9a888001EGUYptdKmGqInq","role":"user","content":"请用 render_a2ui 渲染一个媒体展示 surface（surfaceId=v-media）：Column 根，含 一个 Text（h3 标题\"媒体组件\"）、一个 Icon（name=bar_chart）、一个 Image（url=https://picsum.photos/seed/da/640/200，variant=header）、一个 Video（url=https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4）、一个 AudioPlayer（url=https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.mp3，description=示例音频）。"},{"id":"msg_003b9a899001AfoQuMPwfPY82J-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI media display surface. Let me look at the catalog components: Text, Image, Icon, Video, AudioPlayer, Row, Column, etc.\n\nThe user wants:\n- surfaceId=v-media\n- Column root\n- Text (h3 title \"媒体组件\")\n- Icon (name=bar_chart)\n- Image (url=https://picsum.photos/seed/da/640/200, variant=header)\n- Video (url=https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4)\n- AudioPlayer (url=https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.mp3, description=示例音频)\n\nComponents are flat array with children referenced by id, root id must be \"root\".\n\nLet me build this."},{"id":"msg_003b9a899001AfoQuMPwfPY82J","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_JFWkXfLP624PvqcrHqX39800","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"v-media\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"title\",\"icon\",\"image\",\"video\",\"audio\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"title\",\"text\":\"媒体组件\",\"variant\":\"h3\"},{\"component\":\"Icon\",\"id\":\"icon\",\"name\":\"bar_chart\"},{\"component\":\"Image\",\"id\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://picsum.photos/seed/da/640/200\",\"variant\":\"header\"},{\"component\":\"Video\",\"id\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"component\":\"AudioPlayer\",\"id\":\"audio\",\"url\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.mp3\",\"description\":\"示例音频\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_JFWkXfLP624PvqcrHqX39800","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_JFWkXfLP624PvqcrHqX39800","content":"UI surface \"v-media\" rendered (6 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."}]}

